  CellName: Regatta
  Description: 'Regatta course-pool entry 7, shuffle course Course6
    (CellTypeChoiceOptions.CourseVariantWise, list order = Regatta Course Pool order - the
    host deals one enabled entry per match). A searched course: its rails prefab carries the
    whole RegattaCourseGenome (circuit, braid, features, placements), the one the real-game
    judge raced. Shuffle course 6: polished-five spread 1.34x card, 1.20x L5 (3 seeds,
    real-game judge). 2076 prisms measured; PhaseThresholds ride that count at the rail
    prism''s nominal volume plus a trail band. The spawn profile is the Barren cell''s (no
    flora, no fauna). Regenerate with Tools/Build/author_regatta_assets.py from
    Tools/Build/regatta_shuffle_pool.json, never by hand.'
